WEBVTT

00:16.392 --> 00:19.335
Hear that rumble bleeding through the door

00:23.778 --> 00:26.721
Another heavy footstep on the floor

00:31.365 --> 00:34.928
The press is waiting, cameras in the hall

00:38.251 --> 00:42.815
Waiting for the moment that we fall

00:47.068 --> 00:49.709
Them wait out in the cold

00:52.289 --> 01:00.572
I'm so tired of doing what we're told In this

01:00.692 --> 01:09.374
room, the walls are thick and deep We can finally

01:10.254 --> 01:12.895
let the monsters sleep

01:16.012 --> 01:19.714
Close the blinds and lock the heavy gate Let the

01:19.854 --> 01:24.035
noise outside just dissipate When the world

01:24.095 --> 01:28.597
gets loud and demands a show We find a quiet place

01:28.777 --> 01:32.319
they'll never know Just the strum of the strings

01:32.399 --> 01:37.001
and the hum of the light Keeping the noise

01:37.141 --> 01:38.762
outside tonight

01:59.493 --> 02:04.175
They want the friction, they want the blazing

02:04.395 --> 02:12.559
fire They wanna see us burning on the wire

02:22.408 --> 02:27.151
You're the only truth I want to hear

02:30.814 --> 02:34.556
Close the blinds and lock the heavy gate Let the

02:34.656 --> 02:38.739
noise outside just dissipate When the world

02:38.819 --> 02:43.322
gets loud and demands a show We find a quiet place

02:43.422 --> 02:46.944
they'll never know Just the strum of the strings

02:47.024 --> 02:51.608
and the hum of the light Keeping the noise

02:51.748 --> 02:52.308
outside

02:58.386 --> 03:12.332
Let the noise outside Just fade away

03:12.692 --> 03:15.994
Just fade away

03:21.776 --> 03:21.996
Hmm

